open.\nThis is how I dress: https://twitter.com/4Lx3NIDhg4XwECi/status/1758148710654255182\n\nThe material URL is for the original character.\nHer features are blond bob. Black-white eyes. Black fingernails. She is muscular and taller than 180. She is a bad girl of the alien type.\nThat's all.\n\nhttps://greatbouquetpuppythings.tumblr.com/", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ebiblue/works/268", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/55c3b0a6/uploads/origins/cd74b958-44a2-4ed6-8c00-da1300ccdb9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=95f8e2f0b9eaa21c6b9b401237174b0e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/55c3b0a6/uploads/origins/cd74b958-44a2-4ed6-8c00-da1300ccdb9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=95f8e2f0b9eaa21c6b9b401237174b0e, https://si.imgix.net/55c3b0a6/uploads/origins/cd74b958-44a2-4ed6-8c00-da1300ccdb9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1a44992e3fc6d0608900b0341a66cf3d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/55c3b0a6/uploads/origins/cd74b958-44a2-4ed6-8c00-da1300ccdb9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7e8072d56be8ea792f4e88df6f5cca35 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi, could you draw my new OC's outfit in your style?\n\nHe is a cute feminine boy, who's very bratty and smug, but also shy. I want to see what you could make with this. \n\nMake him smug, and pose and everything else is up to you.\n\nこんにちは、私の新しいOCの服をあなたのスタイルで描いていただけませんか？\n\n彼はとても生意気で自惚れ屋なんだけど、シャイでもあるかわいい女性的な男の子なんだ。これでどんなものができるか見てみたい。\n\nドヤ顔で、ポーズも何もかもあなた次第。\n\nReff: https://imgur.com/a/xsUsiMs", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ebiblue/works/267", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b7f87f1d/uploads/origins/a3120437-c2d5-403d-8691-739fa759e6a4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt